  message: "RE-MEASURED on grpc (deferred at closure; owner lifted the big-repo rule 2026-10-18): hypergumbo run ~/whole_bunch_of_repos/grpc (e26388c) on dev 8001c9f1da, 327 s wall. 3406 dispatches_to edges (cpp 2489, python 674, objc 60, ruby 29, go 15, unknown 129); 1876 cpp classes record virtual_members. The 11 static false positives this item measured (ConfigSelector::Equals x4, ExternalAccountCredentials::Create x3, Subchannel::Create x2, BaseNode::ChannelArgName, BaseNode::ChannelArgsCompare): 0 dispatches_to edges from any of them. An audit for any cpp dispatch whose parent member is declared static flagged 5 edges from Closure::Run, all of them from grpc_event_engine::experimental::EventEngine::Closure::Run (a pure virtual, include/grpc/event_engine/event_engine.h:135); the static Run belongs to grpc_core::Closure, a different class sharing the short name -- so 0 static false positives. Not measured: how many of the other dispatch edges the old per-hop gate would have emitted (no pre-WI-digaj survey of this checkout to diff against)."  # 22a1
